                                                            <note xml:lang="ar">
                                                                <p>Old Codex written in ancient Naskhi with Kufic features. First 83 original folios contain the Book of Daniel and Salomon’s Proverbs. The rest, in different hand of later Naskhi, contains a historical treatise entitled “Book of the History of Years and Times” from the Creation to the Truce between the Fatimids of Egypt and the Byzantines</p>
                                                            </note>
